  <item>
    <title>Vol.45 我在景德镇捏泥巴</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c5cb7e513a776b5729dadc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c5cb7e513a776b5729dadc</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 09 Feb 2024 06:51:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家过年好，本期欢迎本来老嘉宾左木（AKA 蓝老师）的回归，2023年左木老师实现了自己的梦想之一--做陶瓷。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目左木老师分享了小时候的手工启蒙，工作之后在业余时间如何继续延续自己的爱好，并且一步一步进阶的过程，在去年年中的时候决定去景德镇学了陶瓷。</span></p><span></span><p><span>学完之后，还是对做陶瓷念念不忘，重返景德镇之后，一边继续自己的创作，一边参加一些市集摆摊售卖自己的作品。</span></p><span></span><p><span>左木的小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5df43c8400000000010013ad?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5ebe17c60000000001003866&amp;apptime=1707457470" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5df43c8400000000010013ad?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5ebe17c60000000001003866&amp;apptime=1707457470"><span>小红书链接</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 小时候的手工启蒙：《艺术创想》，《超级变变变》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="545">09:05</a> 石塑黏土花花戒指</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvEoebHwhK6vafZvt-vNXUjaiH2t.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 设计小白狗 logo</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> 玻璃镶嵌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> 第一次参加市集摆摊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a> 种草了陶瓷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 去之前的准备：找住宿、找学校、找搭子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 学习的内容：拉坯、手捏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a> 电窑和气窑的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 左老师完全低估拉坯的难度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 手捏就像是小时候捏泥巴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 手捏小狗</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkys34SIjbkkTuUpFoB8CwB0RpVl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> 体验当地的市集文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2035">33:55</a> 第一次摆野摊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 实验不同的土、釉实现不同的效果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a> 简单介绍陶和瓷的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2420">40:20</a> 匣钵土的特点</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnSr1YElCr8jKk86YsS4YHFShH7H.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2715">45:15</a> 左老师决定延课，再上十天高阶课</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 完课之后，参加了成都的一个商业市集</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsX0m_voPevirYE06Afjd6dd3xjm.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2990">49:50</a> 爆款小狗杯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkh3ZvW9PNgGheUpw2h1b7Y3WgtN.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3090">51:30</a> 线上线下的摆摊经验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">57:00</a> 国庆摆摊，游客非常多</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqkW-3b9l7MnWPGXRXKAqTeMFc0x.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3530">58:50</a> 线上直播的售卖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3780">1:03:00</a> 自己线上直播初体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4080">1:08:00</a> 未来的计划</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/likRBJLuoyrWKz8X1iwyqY23ptC0.m4a" length="70384927" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:27</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi-z-cioGMImVF_5luNQ6gZFCywi.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
