    <guid isPermaLink="false">659be38e1519ccb103c44cbb</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jan 2024 11:59:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期的话题起源于一年前的一个无聊饭后，我无意间看了一个 哈苏X2D中画幅相机的测评视频，看完之后，我迷恋上了哈苏。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> 视频地址： &nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jr4y1Y7mr/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=595f9cd175d0915a3d25417d02986529" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1jr4y1Y7mr/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=595f9cd175d0915a3d25417d02986529"><span>Give people wonderful tools, and they’ll do wonderful things</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63f749ea79d1c9aec859cc24" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63f749ea79d1c9aec859cc24"><span>Vol.19 也许你需要一块 Apple Watch</span></a></p>]]></description>
