  <item>
    <title>Vol.42 书籍是人类进步的阶梯，但搬家的时候不是</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/642558da73768bea35d10092</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">642558da73768bea35d10092</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Mar 2023 09:39:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这两期隔得时间有点久，因为最近又搬家了，为什么要说又呢，因为这是一年内第二次的跨省搬家。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以本期就聊聊搬家的相关事宜：买什么样的搬家工具、选择物流还是搬家公司、不同那个的收纳理念以及宠物托运的杂七杂八等等，希望本期的播客可以让你搬家的时候轻松的一点，最后还是祝大家能不搬家就不搬家。</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">0:00:53</a> 先说说我们的搬家经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">0:02:06</a> 搬家的不同方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">0:04:12</a> 搬家的第一步：卖东西！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="531">0:08:51</a> 前期的准备，需要买的工具</span></p><span></span><p><span>纸箱子尺寸和承重：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqAgAT_aVxlEdlcxTWtA4otIXn_M.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>胶带切割器：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl4yzU7YavUfa94DS-lGJwFXggvK.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>塑料膜：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lo6rZWlAvNlmO0aE2bXLtJHrLn1T.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>塑料编织袋：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpjmJh4EfpbuFf9GrLKMJKSgfuBD.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="901">0:15:01</a> 保护工具的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span>劳保手套：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgoCyOGc0W5ms1jlcCrEK_Zad6YE.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>橡胶手套：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnNhmkYt7CWrqBKsUwK43_brVCd2.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1029">17:09</a> 物流的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">22:19</a> 如何在闲鱼上下单物流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a> 整理和归纳物品的方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 厨房里物品的整理方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1875">31:15</a> 客厅房间物品的整理方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2080">34:40</a> 宠物托运的各种手续还有要注意的事项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 物流的签收以及损坏赔偿</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lj-K8XlW_RC8js2s_e2b6-TI4ipP.m4a" length="68195606" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZpdERaREFIR0FsZlJ0T3RFWTYyMTdBNmU2eXUucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.41 漫步肯尼亚-坐拥非洲小巴黎，还能看到胖斑马</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63ff5c17fac2f9b25257b49f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63ff5c17fac2f9b25257b49f</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 03 Mar 2023 12:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>几年前在机核的核聚变活动上认识了小圆，在得知她在非洲工作之后，邀请了她作为这一期的嘉宾，聊了聊在非洲的生活体验和吃喝玩乐，最后让小圆老师做一次赛博导游向大家推荐肯尼亚的旅游好去处。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目的 BGM 都是小圆和蓝耀合作的作品</span></p><span></span><p><span>小圆老师的音乐账号：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bilibili： <a data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/353213/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0" href="https://space.bilibili.com/353213/?spm_id_from=333.999.0.0">space.bilibili.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>网易云：<a data-url="https://y.music.163.com/m/artist?app_version=8.9.30&amp;id=48576781&amp;userid=122004&amp;dlt=0846" href="https://y.music.163.com/m/artist?app_version=8.9.30&amp;id=48576781&amp;userid=122004&amp;dlt=0846">y.music.163.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>蓝耀的音乐账号：</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易云：<a data-url="https://music.163.com/#/artist?app_version=8.7.65&amp;id=34145328&amp;dlt=0846" href="https://music.163.com/#/artist?app_version=8.7.65&amp;id=34145328&amp;dlt=0846">music.163.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">2:20</a> 启程去肯尼亚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="591">9:51</a> 肯尼亚的地理位置，“非洲小巴黎”称号的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="666">11:06</a> 落地肯尼亚的第一感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 路上偶遇的胖斑马</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiilEHoXGJLh1l2LiseokAQmvz4o.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a> 生活在原始森林周围是怎样的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a> 喜闻乐见的吃喝玩乐环节</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FidF39dmAZ4eVh1Blop9x3uG_SAn.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> 当地的酒吧和 Live House 演出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1672">27:52</a> 圆老师其实是一位音乐人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a> 非洲音乐的特点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1749">29:09</a> 购物体验和网购平台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1945">32:25</a> 小圆老师介绍本期的 BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> 非洲当地的“支付宝”--</span><strong><span>M-Pesa</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2215">36:55</a> 当地人的着装服饰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a> 中国的二手服饰在非洲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2390">39:50</a> 当地的民族：马赛族</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoGlN_CToRrYCNfNeNbtunbKPuxv.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 跳不高的马赛男孩娶不到媳妇？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FirV7Uvei2gAQUA5-S_nizAJgzxM.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2600">43:20</a> 圆老师编非洲麻花辫的新鲜体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2922">48:42</a> 赛博导游圆介绍肯尼亚的旅游好去处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3162">52:42</a> 非洲大草原的五种代表性动物 big five 是什么</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FokOn9O1j1bPLN9V3-ojIAln0bJw.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgwTqIL_Di8jOL7GZaaPwXa9kJ5t.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlWDT7LtAa0E0L4X4YYg8Uma0omw.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsc-Qlln_SqjXgEYTxRdOp_HkSEo.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3496">58:16</a> 非洲人的口头语 hakuna matata 是什么意思？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3532">58:52</a> 介绍安博塞利国家公园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">1:02:00</a> 山上圆滚滚的植物</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsDJExEhFlSKI_GdyzpEdnEMmjmk.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3896">1:04:56</a> 对人类最具危险性的动物居然是河马？</span></p>]]></description>
